<p><span style="color:#000080;"></span><span style="color:#0066cc;"><strong>UN Agencies</strong></span></p>

<p>IMO works with its sister agencies dealing with all major issues surrounding ship recycling, to ensure the safety, sustainable and environmentally sound practices in ship recycling.</p>


